{"version":1,"provider":"Edge neural voices","languages":{"ar":{"locale":"ar-EG","voice":"ar-EG-SalmaNeural","pages":[[{"text":"جاء يوم الحلقة الأولى.","src":"ar/page-1-paragraph-1.mp3","words":[{"text":"جاء","start":0.05,"duration":0.3875},{"text":"يوم","start":0.45,"duration":0.275},{"text":"الحلقة","start":0.7375,"duration":0.5125},{"text":"الأولى","start":1.2625,"duration":0.675}]},{"text":"جلس الأولاد حول الشيخ، وجلست البنات في مكانهن.","src":"ar/page-1-paragraph-2.mp3","words":[{"text":"جلس","start":0.05,"duration":0.525},{"text":"الأولاد","start":0.5875,"duration":0.575},{"text":"حول","start":1.175,"duration":0.275},{"text":"الشيخ","start":1.4625,"duration":0.5875},{"text":"وجلست","start":2.25,"duration":0.675},{"text":"البنات","start":2.9375,"duration":0.575},{"text":"في","start":3.525,"duration":0.175},{"text":"مكانهن","start":3.7125,"duration":0.9}]},{"text":"وكان الجميع ينتظر الدرس الأول بشوق.","src":"ar/page-1-paragraph-3.mp3","words":[{"text":"وكان","start":0.05,"duration":0.4625},{"text":"الجميع","start":0.525,"duration":0.5625},{"text":"ينتظر","start":1.1,"duration":0.525},{"text":"الدرس","start":1.6375,"duration":0.3625},{"text":"الأول","start":2.0125,"duration":0.45},{"text":"بشوق","start":2.475,"duration":0.65}]}],[{"text":"قال الشيخ: «اليوم نبدأ بأعظم ما نتعلمه:","src":"ar/page-2-paragraph-1.mp3","words":[{"text":"قال","start":0.05,"duration":0.2875},{"text":"الشيخ","start":0.35,"duration":0.5875},{"text":"اليوم","start":1.2375,"duration":0.55},{"text":"نبدأ","start":1.8,"duration":0.4375},{"text":"بأعظم","start":2.25,"duration":0.6375},{"text":"ما","start":2.9,"duration":0.175},{"text":"نتعلمه","start":3.0875,"duration":0.85}]},{"text":"الله الواحد الأحد.","src":"ar/page-2-paragraph-2.mp3","words":[{"text":"الله","start":0.05,"duration":0.3875},{"text":"الواحد","start":0.45,"duration":0.5},{"text":"الأحد","start":0.9625,"duration":0.5875}]},{"text":"من يقرأ لنا سورة الإخلاص؟»","src":"ar/page-2-paragraph-3.mp3","words":[{"text":"من","start":0.05,"duration":0.275},{"text":"يقرأ","start":0.3375,"duration":0.4625},{"text":"لنا","start":0.8125,"duration":0.3},{"text":"سورة","start":1.125,"duration":0.4125},{"text":"الإخلاص","start":1.55,"duration":0.8}]}],[{"text":"رفعت سارة يدها، وقرأت بصوت جميل:","src":"ar/page-3-paragraph-1.mp3","words":[{"text":"رفعت","start":0.05,"duration":0.5625},{"text":"سارة","start":0.625,"duration":0.4},{"text":"يدها","start":1.0375,"duration":0.5875},{"text":"وقرأت","start":1.85,"duration":0.6375},{"text":"بصوت","start":2.5,"duration":0.525},{"text":"جميل","start":3.0375,"duration":0.7}]},{"text":"﴿قُلْ هُوَ اللَّهُ أَحَدٌ﴾","src":"ar/page-3-paragraph-2.mp3","words":[{"text":"﴿قُلْ","start":0.05,"duration":0.275},{"text":"هُوَ","start":0.3375,"duration":0.1875},{"text":"اللَّهُ","start":0.5375,"duration":0.4125},{"text":"أَحَدٌ﴾","start":0.9625,"duration":0.6375}]},{"text":"﴿اللَّهُ الصَّمَدُ ۝ لَمْ يَلِدْ وَلَمْ يُولَدْ﴾","src":"ar/page-3-paragraph-3.mp3","words":[{"text":"﴿اللَّهُ","start":0.05,"duration":0.3625},{"text":"الصَّمَدُ","start":0.425,"duration":0.4875},{"text":"لَمْ","start":0.925,"duration":0.1875},{"text":"يَلِدْ","start":1.125,"duration":0.325},{"text":"وَلَمْ","start":1.4625,"duration":0.325},{"text":"يُولَدْ﴾","start":1.8,"duration":0.6375}]}]]},"en":{"locale":"en-US","voice":"en-US-AriaNeural","pages":[[{"text":"The day of the first circle arrived.","src":"en/page-1-paragraph-1.mp3","words":[{"text":"The","start":0.05,"duration":0.1625},{"text":"day","start":0.225,"duration":0.225},{"text":"of","start":0.4625,"duration":0.0875},{"text":"the","start":0.5625,"duration":0.0875},{"text":"first","start":0.6625,"duration":0.325},{"text":"circle","start":1.0,"duration":0.3875},{"text":"arrived","start":1.4,"duration":0.6}]},{"text":"The boys sat around the sheikh, and the girls sat in their own place.","src":"en/page-1-paragraph-2.mp3","words":[{"text":"The","start":0.05,"duration":0.1625},{"text":"boys","start":0.225,"duration":0.35},{"text":"sat","start":0.5875,"duration":0.2125},{"text":"around","start":0.8125,"duration":0.3125},{"text":"the","start":1.1375,"duration":0.05},{"text":"sheikh","start":1.2,"duration":0.425},{"text":"and","start":1.8375,"duration":0.0875},{"text":"the","start":1.9375,"duration":0.1},{"text":"girls","start":2.05,"duration":0.35},{"text":"sat","start":2.4125,"duration":0.2625},{"text":"in","start":2.6875,"duration":0.0625},{"text":"their","start":2.7625,"duration":0.1875},{"text":"own","start":2.9625,"duration":0.1875},{"text":"place","start":3.1625,"duration":0.525}]},{"text":"Everyone was excited for the first lesson.","src":"en/page-1-paragraph-3.mp3","words":[{"text":"Everyone","start":0.05,"duration":0.4875},{"text":"was","start":0.55,"duration":0.125},{"text":"excited","start":0.6875,"duration":0.525},{"text":"for","start":1.225,"duration":0.1},{"text":"the","start":1.3375,"duration":0.0875},{"text":"first","start":1.4375,"duration":0.35},{"text":"lesson","start":1.8,"duration":0.475}]}],[{"text":"The sheikh said: “Today we begin with the greatest thing we can learn:","src":"en/page-2-paragraph-1.mp3","words":[{"text":"The","start":0.05,"duration":0.1625},{"text":"sheikh","start":0.225,"duration":0.3125},{"text":"said","start":0.55,"duration":0.3375},{"text":"Today","start":1.1125,"duration":0.3375},{"text":"we","start":1.4625,"duration":0.1125},{"text":"begin","start":1.5875,"duration":0.3375},{"text":"with","start":1.9375,"duration":0.1125},{"text":"the","start":2.0625,"duration":0.0875},{"text":"greatest","start":2.1625,"duration":0.4125},{"text":"thing","start":2.5875,"duration":0.2125},{"text":"we","start":2.8125,"duration":0.1125},{"text":"can","start":2.9375,"duration":0.1625},{"text":"learn","start":3.1125,"duration":0.4}]},{"text":"Allah is The One.","src":"en/page-2-paragraph-2.mp3","words":[{"text":"Allah","start":0.05,"duration":0.375},{"text":"is","start":0.4375,"duration":0.1375},{"text":"The","start":0.5875,"duration":0.1},{"text":"One","start":0.7,"duration":0.4125}]},{"text":"Who will recite Surat al-Ikhlas for us?”","src":"en/page-2-paragraph-3.mp3","words":[{"text":"Who","start":0.05,"duration":0.2},{"text":"will","start":0.2625,"duration":0.1375},{"text":"recite","start":0.4125,"duration":0.4},{"text":"Surat","start":0.825,"duration":0.3375},{"text":"al-Ikhlas","start":1.175,"duration":0.5125},{"text":"for","start":1.7,"duration":0.1875},{"text":"us","start":1.9,"duration":0.3375}]}],[{"text":"Sara raised her hand and recited in a beautiful voice:","src":"en/page-3-paragraph-1.mp3","words":[{"text":"Sara","start":0.05,"duration":0.4625},{"text":"raised","start":0.525,"duration":0.325},{"text":"her","start":0.8625,"duration":0.1},{"text":"hand","start":0.975,"duration":0.3625},{"text":"and","start":1.35,"duration":0.1625},{"text":"recited","start":1.525,"duration":0.5},{"text":"in","start":2.0375,"duration":0.1375},{"text":"a","start":2.1875,"duration":0.0625},{"text":"beautiful","start":2.2625,"duration":0.4125},{"text":"voice","start":2.6875,"duration":0.525}]},{"text":"“Say: He is Allah, the One.","src":"en/page-3-paragraph-2.mp3","words":[{"text":"Say","start":0.05,"duration":0.5125},{"text":"He","start":0.7625,"duration":0.1375},{"text":"is","start":0.9125,"duration":0.15},{"text":"Allah","start":1.075,"duration":0.325},{"text":"the","start":1.6125,"duration":0.1},{"text":"One","start":1.725,"duration":0.4}]},{"text":"Allah, the Eternal Refuge. He neither begets nor is born.”","src":"en/page-3-paragraph-3.mp3","words":[{"text":"Allah","start":0.05,"duration":0.3875},{"text":"the","start":0.575,"duration":0.075},{"text":"Eternal","start":0.6625,"duration":0.45},{"text":"Refuge","start":1.125,"duration":0.6625},{"text":"He","start":2.65,"duration":0.1625},{"text":"neither","start":2.825,"duration":0.3125},{"text":"begets","start":3.15,"duration":0.4},{"text":"nor","start":3.5625,"duration":0.2625},{"text":"is","start":3.8375,"duration":0.125},{"text":"born","start":3.975,"duration":0.45}]}]]}}}